CDialogTree
{
Name=Broadcast Probe
Portrait=!None
Should Have Voiceovers=0
Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 Conversation Start
Text=<PLAYTEST PROBE - shared-name broadcast test>  The question is whether one action can reach every entity sharing a name.  Fifteen troll generators here spawn under the name 'Lava Troll'.  Thirteen more spawn with NO name and can never be reached this way - so if the broadcast works you should see roughly HALF the pit go quiet, not all of it.  Half is the success signal.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=1. THE TEST - stop every troll named 'Lava Troll'.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CSetTargetTypeAction
{
Entity Name=Lava Troll
Name To Target=
Valid Targets=
}
Action=CPrintCombatTextAction
{
Text to print=BROADCAST fired. Walk in. Half the pit going quiet means it works; none means it does not.
Character to show text to=$Instigator
Emphasize=1
Suppress Duplicates=0
}
}
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=2. THE CONTROL - stop the warning troll (use this AFTER he attacks).
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CSetTargetTypeAction
{
Entity Name=warning troll
Name To Target=
Valid Targets=
}
Action=CPrintCombatTextAction
{
Text to print=CONTROL fired. If he breaks off, single-name targeting works and option 1's result is trustworthy.
Character to show text to=$Instigator
Emphasize=1
Suppress Duplicates=0
}
}
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=3. Switch off the warning troll's ambush trigger.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CDeactivateAction
{
Target Name=make troll mad
}
Action=CPrintCombatTextAction
{
Text to print='make troll mad' switched off. He will not jump you now.
Character to show text to=$Instigator
Emphasize=1
Suppress Duplicates=0
}
}
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=4. Strip the attack cursor from every troll named 'Lava Troll'.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CRemoveAIAction
{
Target Name=Lava Troll
AI=CAIInteractionSpecifier
Delay Between Removes=0
}
Action=CPrintCombatTextAction
{
Text to print=Specifiers stripped. If the attack cursor is gone from the calm trolls, Target Name= broadcasts too - which answers the wererat question as well.
Character to show text to=$Instigator
Emphasize=1
Suppress Duplicates=0
}
}
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=5. DECLARE PEACE - keep pacifying trolls as they spawn.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CActivateAction
{
Target Name=Troll Peace Keeper
Play Activate Sound=0
Delay Between Activations=0
Warp Behavior=
}
Action=CPrintCombatTextAction
{
Text to print=Peace keeper running. Walk the WHOLE pit, south path included. Anything spawning should settle within a couple of seconds.
Character to show text to=$Instigator
Emphasize=1
Suppress Duplicates=0
}
}
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=6. Break the peace (stop the keeper).
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CMultipleActionsAction
{
Action=Array
{
Item Count=2
Action=CDeactivateAction
{
Target Name=Troll Peace Keeper
}
Action=CPrintCombatTextAction
{
Text to print=Peace keeper stopped. Newly spawned trolls will stay hostile.
Character to show text to=$Instigator
Emphasize=1
Suppress Duplicates=0
}
}
}
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nothing for now.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=90 troll bark 1
Text=<The troll watches you pass, and grumbles somewhere deep in its chest.>
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=90 troll bark 2
Text=<It does not move aside. It does not move at all.>
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=90 troll bark 3
Text=<A low sound, more rock than throat. Whatever it means, it is not welcome.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=95 the chief
Text=<He is a head taller than the others and does not grumble. He looks at you the way a man looks at weather.>  You walk in my rock and my people do not stop you. So. Say the thing you came to say.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=<PLACEHOLDER - the debt negotiation goes here.>
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
}
